+
+This is another nice AI improvement and a critical as in annoying if i may say but anyways etc issue base AdvCiv +/- civ4 AI had, that was that it was way too easy to abuse its early trading, because it gave the same gold per turn for for example pig (that gives only +1 health) than for for example maize or wheat (that give almost always +2 health since almost all cities have a granary very early in the game anyways etc), so wheat should be more or less double the price of pig, not same price (e.g. it should be 4 gpt for maize/wheat vs 2 gpt for pig/cattle).
